# The Dockerfile builds a toolchain image whose only COPYs come from other build
# stages (--from=docker-cli, --from=rust); it consumes NO files from the build
# context. Exclude the heavy paths so `docker build <repo-root>` (used by the
# iresearch/SereneDB engine) doesn't tar and ship the 8 GB corpus, the vendored
# submodules, and every engine's build/index output to the daemon.
.git
corpus.json
*.json
results
node_modules
web
target
engines/*/build
engines/*/build_debug
engines/*/idx
engines/*/target
engines/*/serenedb
